      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Nazi_Germany",
      "label": "Nazi Germany",
      "description": "The German state under the leadership of Adolf Hitler and the Nazi Party from 1933 to 1945. The regime was characterized by totalitarian control, racial ideology, and genocide. The swastika armband visible on the figure in the image is a direct symbol of this regime, and the meme's condemnation relies on the historical understanding of Nazi Germany as the state responsible for the Holocaust and other crimes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_37a6d23c"
