      "instance_name": "Historical_Propaganda",
      "label": "Historical Propaganda",
      "description": "The use of media and imagery to promote a political agenda or ideology. The meme functions as a form of historical propaganda, using the iconic image of Hitler and stark text to convey a moral message. The effectiveness of the meme relies on the viewer's understanding of how historical propaganda has been used to shape public perception of historical figures and events.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
