      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Moral_Condemnation",
      "label": "Moral Condemnation",
      "description": "The act of expressing strong disapproval or judgment of a person or action based on moral principles. The meme's intent is to deliver a moral condemnation of Hitler's actions. This requires the viewer to understand the concept of moral condemnation as a form of ethical judgment, which is a piece of background knowledge about social and ethical norms.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_37a6d23c"
